<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<CustomObject xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <!--
      THIS COMMENT IS INSIDE THE ROOT ELEMENT ON PURPOSE - a comment ABOVE the root breaks sf at
      source conversion with a misleading "unable to find matching parent xml" error.

      LOOKUP TO Transaction__c, NOT MASTER-DETAIL, and required=false. Three reasons:
        1. A Loan exists only when Loan_Required__c is true, so a platform-required parent is the
           wrong shape - the object is conditional by design, which is the same condition that makes
           checklist group F conditional.
        2. required=true on a lookup FORCES deleteConstraint=Restrict. That is exactly the defect
           Critical_Date__c.Transaction__c carries: once a child exists the Transaction can never be
           deleted, so "delete the deal and re-fan it" stops being a repair path and the delete in
           scripts/seed-transactions.apex throws on every rebuilt org.
        3. A loan is a real business record a person owns and may need shared independently. Unlike
           a checklist, it is not an inseparable part of the deal row, so ControlledByParent would
           overstate the coupling.
      Presence of the Transaction is enforced by the service that creates the record, not by a
      required flag. If the business later wants a hard rule, use a VALIDATION RULE - not
      required=true, which would additionally make the field non-permissionable and force it out of
      every permission set.

      NO BANK ACCOUNT NUMBERS AND NO ROUTING NUMBERS ON THIS OBJECT OR ANY OTHER (Decision 3).
      Bank_Account_Type__c is an account TYPE (Operating / Escrow / Reserve / Other), not an account
      NUMBER. It is safe, and checklist group F needs it. Do not later "harden" it away.
    -->
    <allowInChatterGroups>false</allowInChatterGroups>
    <compactLayoutAssignment>SYSTEM</compactLayoutAssignment>
    <deploymentStatus>Deployed</deploymentStatus>
    <description>Acquisition financing for a Transaction - lender, amount, term, rate, commitment date and the auto-payment setup state. Created only on deals where Loan_Required__c is true, the same condition that fans out checklist group F. Backs checklist items F5 to F11 and the two CRITICAL auto-payment items F12 and J4. Holds no bank account or routing numbers.</description>
    <enableActivities>false</enableActivities>
    <enableBulkApi>true</enableBulkApi>
    <enableFeeds>false</enableFeeds>
    <enableHistory>false</enableHistory>
    <enableLicensing>false</enableLicensing>
    <enableReports>true</enableReports>
    <enableSearch>true</enableSearch>
    <enableSharing>true</enableSharing>
    <enableStreamingApi>true</enableStreamingApi>
    <externalSharingModel>Private</externalSharingModel>
    <label>Loan</label>
    <nameField>
        <displayFormat>LOAN-{0000}</displayFormat>
        <label>Loan Number</label>
        <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
        <type>AutoNumber</type>
    </nameField>
    <pluralLabel>Loans</pluralLabel>
    <searchLayouts></searchLayouts>
    <sharingModel>Private</sharingModel>
    <visibility>Public</visibility>
</CustomObject>
